| Area | Problem (Why It Matters) | Recommendation | Why it matters |
|------|--------------------------|----------------|----------------|
| **Security Headers** | Express serves without bolt‑on security headers (XSS, MIME sniffing, click‑jacking…) | `helmet()` middleware | Sets a broad range of headers; mitigates many OWASP Top‑10 attacks. |
