## 4️⃣ A Few Security‑Specific Spots You Can Keep an Eye On

| Threat | Preventive measure | Where to apply |
|--------|--------------------|----------------|
| **Open Redirect / Referrer Leakage** | Sanitize any URL fields (`req.body.url`) before redirecting. | `express-validator` `isURL()` |
| **Injection (SQL, NoSQL, Command)** | Never build raw queries from string concatenation. Use parameterized queries (or an ORM). | Database code, not here |
| **DOM / Template XSS** | Encode all data when rendering. | Front‑end. |
| **Click‑jacking** | `helmet.frameguard()` (enabled by default in `helmet()`). |
| **HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS)** | `helmet.hsts()` (default in `helmet()`). |
| **Content Security Policy (CSP)** | `helmet.csp()` – let’s just say you’ll want a CSP in prod. |
| **Cache Control** | Set `Cache-Control: no-store` for sensitive endpoints. | `helmet.noCache()` |

